OL,7,G0855 Four in a Bed
OL,8,     FThe first visit is to Bowlees Farm
OL,9,     FHoliday Cottages in County Durham,
OL,10,     Frun by Tony and Viv. Their guests
OL,11,     Flove the views, pool and hot tubs,
OL,12,     Fbut will they pay top dollar for
OL,13,     Ftheir stay?
OL,14,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,15,     FJohn and Leslie host at The
OL,16,     FPiebald Inn in Hunmanby, North
OL,17,     FYorkshire. After a visit to a
OL,18,     Fmodel village, will their guests'
OL,19,     Fmixed reviews leave a bitter
OL,20,     Ftaste?
